# --scene Assets/Scenes/Tests/EcsTest.lvl
# ECS contract from C# (issue board #7): Assets/Scripts/Tests/EcsTests.cs runs as [GameTest]s in Play:
# entity lifetime and generational handles, components by type and by name, reflected fields,
# queries, hierarchy and world positions, activity, layers, GUIDs, bulk cleanup.
#   ./.build/Editor_Debug/Havana --scene Assets/Scenes/Tests/EcsTest.lvl --editor-exec Assets/Scenes/Tests/EcsFlows.edscript
wait-log dotnet ready | 7200
wait 30
play
assert-playing 1
wait 30
console game-tests EcsTests
wait-log GameTests: 5 passed, 0 failed | 2400
stop
quit
